          "settings": {
            "title": "The Ultimate Guide for Pain Relief — Uses, Dosage, Benefits & FAQs",
            "text": "<p>Discover rapid, targeted pain relief with <strong>Lidocaine Injections</strong> — the gold-standard <strong>local anesthetic injection</strong> trusted by health professionals worldwide. Lidocaine (also marketed as Xylocaine) is clinically proven to <strong>numb pain fast</strong>, making it a top choice for <strong>pain management</strong>, <strong>dental anesthesia</strong>, <strong>minor surgical procedures</strong>, <strong>nerve blocks</strong>, and <strong>chronic pain relief</strong>.</p><h3>Key Features & Top Health Benefits:</h3><ul><li><strong>Fast-Acting Local Anesthetic:</strong> Achieve near-instant pain relief with onset within 1-3 minutes.</li><li><strong>Long-Lasting Effect:</strong> Enjoy up to 1-3 hours of numbness for extended procedures or acute pain control.</li><li><strong>Multiple Uses:</strong> Ideal for dental work, wound suturing, minor surgeries, skin disorders, and relieving <strong>neuropathic pain</strong>, <strong>back pain</strong>, or <strong>muscle pain</strong>.</li><li><strong>Convenient Dosage Forms:</strong> Available in various strengths to suit your medical needs — always administered by a healthcare professional for safety.</li><li><strong>Top Choice for Professionals:</strong> Frequently chosen for <strong>local anesthesia</strong> in hospitals and clinics, dentistry, and even tattoo parlors.</li></ul><p><strong>Choose Lidocaine Injections for proven, precise, and safe pain management.</strong><br/><em>Always administered or supervised by a licensed healthcare professional.</em></p>",
            "heading_size": "small",
            "text_alignment": "left"
          }
        }
